## JavaScript modules

A **module** is bundled JavaScript that your script can import. Use the exact keys registered by your host in the Markdown attribute `uses`, separated by spaces. If the host registers `backoff@1`, for example, `uses="backoff@1"` makes `await import("backoff")` available. A type includes the modules listed in its table row. Each saved document version retains the module code it used.

